@format 1
@id functionality.media-loading.common.completion
@title Media loading — common completion routing
@section Functionality
@area Media loading — Common
@entry backend-outcome
@summary Trace the backend completion event through viewer staleness/failure filtering and preview-engine routing.
@related functionality.media-loading.common.mpv, functionality.media-loading.common.flyleaf, functionality.media-loading.common.publication
@tag media
@tag loading
@tag common
@tag completion

@alias media-load = Cadroue.Media.LMediaLoad
@alias viewer = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PViewer

[backend-outcome] Current backend outcome <input>
- Raise LMediaLoadCompleted and isolate subscriber exceptions @ media-load.LMediaLoadRaise(...)
> completion-filter

[completion-filter] Viewer completion acceptance <decision>
- Marshal completion onto the viewer dispatcher and compare lifetime, load serial, and expected source path @ viewer.PViewerLoadHandle(...)
? "Viewer request is stale" > stale
? "Current backend failure" > failed-status
? "Current backend success" > engine-route

[stale] Stale completion ignored <output>
= The completion belongs to an older or inactive viewer request and cannot replace current viewer state.

[failed-status] Unreadable media cargo <process>
- Build viewer cargo containing the failed source and backend error without media information or preview availability @ viewer.PViewerLoadHandle(...)
> map:functionality.media-loading.common.publication

[engine-route] Preview engine routing <decision>
- Route successful media information to mpv when mpv is active, otherwise continue through Flyleaf @ viewer.PPlayerMediaApply(...)
? "mpv active" > map:functionality.media-loading.common.mpv
? "Flyleaf active" > map:functionality.media-loading.common.flyleaf
